 "accommodation": {
  "name": "Villa el Cano",
  "blurb": "“The Villa Hat-Trick” – a third consecutive year at Villa el Cano. Twenty dogs again, with Finca Cortesin, Alferini and Los Flamingos on the card.\n\nVilla el Cano is a ten-bedroom private estate above Puerto Banús on the Marbella coast, in a gated community overlooking Los Flamingos golf club, with views across the countryside to the Mediterranean. It has heated indoor and outdoor pools, a sauna and jacuzzi, a tennis court, a putting green, an outdoor bar and BBQ area, and air-conditioned en-suite bedrooms throughout.",
